{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02222","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昇平乐 四 · 薛能","name":"杂曲歌辞 昇平乐 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曙质绝埃氛，彤庭列禁军。\n圣颜初对日，龙尾竞缘云。\n佩响交成韵，帘阴暖带纹。\n逍遥岂有事，於此咏南薰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}